  "post_content": "<p>El Centro de Empleo y Cultura de Onda acoge hasta el 19 de abril la original exposici&oacute;n Pintando a la m&uacute;sica, de Lorenzo Ram&iacute;rez, que se inaugur&oacute; anoche con m&uacute;sica en directo a cargo del violoncelista Jos&eacute; Enrique Bouch&eacute;, como el pintor tambi&eacute;n de Borriol.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/03/IMG_1406.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El comisario de la exposici&oacute;n es el ondense Joan Feliu, que hizo una introducci&oacute;n a la muestra, de la que prepara una publicaci&oacute;n.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expomusicallorenzo/img_1406.jpg\" alt=\"img_1406\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expomusicallorenzo/img_1407.jpg\" alt=\"img_1407\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expomusicallorenzo/img_1409.jpg\" alt=\"img_1409\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expomusicallorenzo/img_1410.jpg\" alt=\"img_1410\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expomusicallorenzo/img_1411.jpg\" alt=\"img_1411\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expomusicallorenzo/img_1412.jpg\" alt=\"img_1412\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expomusicallorenzo/img_1413.jpg\" alt=\"img_1413\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expomusicallorenzo/img_1415.jpg\" alt=\"img_1415\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a97